  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 707.08 Additional Sampling by Department",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 707.08 Additional Sampling by Department. Nothing in this chapter shall be construed to preclude the department, or any duly designated representative of the department, from:\n\n(a) Collecting samples; or\n\n(b) Using the results from such samples to determine compliance by a system with the applicable requirements of this chapter.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12666, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
